      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "# TRELLIS.2 multi-view model-sheet input\n\nLoad separate images for Camera 000° (front), 090° (left), 180° (rear), and 270° (right). Keep pose, scale, centerline, lighting, and canvas dimensions consistent.\n\nEach view is background-cleaned independently, encoded independently by DINOv3, and combined as one ordered conditioning context. Do not use a flattened contact sheet here; keep that artifact for human review only.\n\nAll four cardinal camera branches pass through an independent CFP Input Mask Quality Gate. One blocked view stops reconstruction before the native engine starts. RMBG MASK sockets remain disconnected because the gates derive standard ComfyUI mask polarity from RGBA alpha.\n\nCamera 270° is the right-side profile and is now a required populated lane in this four-view workbench.\n\nAfter all four per-view mask gates pass, the CFP Model-Sheet Consistency Gate compares canvas size, normalized subject height, centerline, vertical center, baseline, and opposing-view width before TRELLIS starts."
      ],
      "color": "#493b1f",
      "bgcolor": "#6a5730",
      "title": "Model Sheet Input Contract"
    },
